    text-decoration-color, fill, stroke, opacity, box-shadow, filter,
    transform, translate, scale, rotate;
  transition-duration: var(--ui-motion-duration-fast);
  transition-timing-function: var(--ui-motion-ease-standard);
}

/* Overlay enter/exit timing based on overlay type: */
.ds-motion-overlay[data-state="open"] {
  animation-duration: var(--ui-motion-duration-fast);
  animation-timing-function: var(--ui-motion-ease-enter);
}
.ds-motion-overlay[data-state="closed"] {
  animation-duration: var(--ui-motion-duration-fast);
  animation-timing-function: var(--ui-motion-ease-exit);
}

.ds-motion-overlay-dialog[data-state="open"] {
  animation-duration: var(--ui-motion-duration-base);
  animation-timing-function: var(--ui-motion-ease-enter);
}
.ds-motion-overlay-dialog[data-state="closed"] {
  animation-duration: var(--ui-motion-duration-fast);
  animation-timing-function: var(--ui-motion-ease-exit);
}

.ds-motion-overlay-sheet[data-state="open"] {
  animation-duration: var(--ui-motion-duration-slow);
  animation-timing-function: var(--ui-motion-ease-enter);
}
.ds-motion-overlay-sheet[data-state="closed"] {
  animation-duration: var(--ui-motion-duration-base);
  animation-timing-function: var(--ui-motion-ease-exit);
}
```

**Popover animation pattern**:
```tsx
className={cn(
  "z-50 overflow-hidden rounded-normal",
  "border border-solid border-border-popovers bg-modal-surface shadow-menu",
  "data-[state=open]:animate-in data-[state=closed]:animate-out",
  "data-[state=open]:fade-in-0 data-[state=closed]:fade-out-0",
  "data-[state=open]:zoom-in-95 data-[state=closed]:zoom-out-95",
  "ds-motion-overlay",
  "ds-radix-popover-content-origin",
  className,
)}
```

**Sheet animation pattern** (side-dependent slides):
```tsx
"data-[state=open]:slide-in-from-left-[20%] data-[state=closed]:slide-out-to-left-[20%]"
// Or: right, top, bottom variants with similar pattern
```

### **Key Architectural Patterns Identified**:

1. **Thin Radix Wrapper** — Export Radix primitives as-is (`const Sheet = DialogPrimitive.Root`), then create custom components (forwardRef'd) for content layers
2. **CVA for Variants** — Use `class-variance-authority` for cva-based variant management (e.g., SheetSide variants)
3. **Constants File** — Server-safe (no "use client") enum/constant objects for variants/sizes
4. **Animation on data-state** — Use Tailwind's `data-[state=open]:animate-in` + motion helper classes like `ds-motion-overlay`
5. **Motion classes delegate to CSS layers** — Components use only Tailwind utilities; CSS layer definitions in `dooph-component-tokens.css` set actual `animation-duration` and `animation-timing-function`
6. **Portal pattern** — Optional portal rendering with `portal` prop + `portalProps` for container override
7. **Shared primitives** — Reuse modal/dialog shells (`DialogShellContent`, `DialogShellOverlay`) across components (Sheet, Modal)
8. **Story structure** — One TypeScript story file per component showing variants, controlled state, and edge cases

